    en: ["Abua Awas Yojana (Jharkhand)", "₹2 lakh to build a 3-room pucca house for families left out of PM Awas.", "Poor families living in a kutcha house who did not get a PM Awas house get ₹2 lakh from the state to build a 3-room house. The money comes in stages as building moves ahead."],
